      "content": "hey so i was just watching that new interview with alexander sterling and something felt totally off. like, did you notice his blinking pattern? it looked super staggered, almost like his left eye was lagging behind the right one by a fraction of a second. it felt really mechanical. does that even happen normally or is that some kind of weird processing glitch?",
