    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont think it was just anxiety... anxiety usually makes u blink MORE often, not like a laggy video file. and he looked so much more \"stiff\" than he did in his movies from like 3 years ago. it's almost like the person we're seeing now is just a really high-end digital projection or a body double using some kind of advanced facial mapping. i've been seeing these theories online that the real sterling was replaced after that accident in london... do you think it's even possible for modern tech to replicate those micro-expressions closely enough to fool most people?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
